<title>USA: Fuisz Technologies to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Fuisz Technologies to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>CHANTILLY, Va. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fuisz Technologies Ltd said Thursday it plans to buy back up to one million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The transactions are to occur from time to time in the open market or in private transactions.</p>
<p>Fuisz Technologies develops and sells a range of drug delivery, nutraceutical, food and confectionary applications.</p>
</text>
